WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:14.110
A real reply pauses for two approval questions.

00:00:14.110 --> 00:00:17.476
Answer the complete batch before resuming.

00:00:17.476 --> 00:00:23.150
Resume sends both answers and continues the same turn.

00:00:23.150 --> 00:00:24.864
Resume complete.

00:00:24.864 --> 00:00:30.302
A new turn gets a new approval batch.

00:00:30.302 --> 00:00:35.410
Read-only replay.

00:00:35.410 --> 00:00:37.367
Back live. Paused.
